{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/join_the_journey.png?t=1753429736\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a palace lost to time in this cozy Mughal Steampunk point and click math puzzle adventure\u2014solve over 40 time-based challenges with the help of a steampunk genie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Engage in a Point-and-Click Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the palace gates, click around, and discover hidden gems, engravings, and cryptic notes to gain entry. Where some players see an obstacle, others spot an opportunity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Solve Time-Based Math Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click, rotate, and sequence clock hands. Each puzzle brings unexpected challenges\u2014buzzing beetles, glowing dials, clicking gears, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.poster.avif?t=1753429736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.webm?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.mp4?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Interact with Time Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you unravel the palace\u2019s mysteries, encounter interactive Time Keepers, Time Lines, and Time Gears that reveal a story frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Collect &amp; Manipulate Time Gems with the Genie</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As a silent traveler, use logic and carefully follow the hints given by your genie companion. Gather, combine, and split time gems to help restore the palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.poster.avif?t=1753429736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.webm?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.mp4?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're here to crack challenging puzzles or simply soak in a beautiful Mughal Steampunk experience, <strong>Clockwork Palace</strong> offers something magical for every type of player. And for those seeking an extra challenge... the palace holds a secret just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/033ebba0a8377f59f611a6de3e439276.avif?t=1753429736\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463220?t=1753429736","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463220?t=1753429736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/2b204394cffa1cca8ce2dd52d65c733480f3e3a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753429736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/2b204394cffa1cca8ce2dd52d65c733480f3e3a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753429736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/join_the_journey.png?t=1753429736\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a palace lost to time in this cozy Mughal Steampunk point and click math puzzle adventure\u2014solve over 40 time-based challenges with the help of a steampunk genie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Engage in a Point-and-Click Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the palace gates, click around, and discover hidden gems, engravings, and cryptic notes to gain entry. Where some players see an obstacle, others spot an opportunity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Solve Time-Based Math Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click, rotate, and sequence clock hands. Each puzzle brings unexpected challenges\u2014buzzing beetles, glowing dials, clicking gears, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.poster.avif?t=1753429736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.webm?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.mp4?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Interact with Time Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you unravel the palace\u2019s mysteries, encounter interactive Time Keepers, Time Lines, and Time Gears that reveal a story frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Collect &amp; Manipulate Time Gems with the Genie</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As a silent traveler, use logic and carefully follow the hints given by your genie companion. Gather, combine, and split time gems to help restore the palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.poster.avif?t=1753429736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.webm?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.mp4?t=1753429736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're here to crack challenging puzzles or simply soak in a beautiful Mughal Steampunk experience, <strong>Clockwork Palace</strong> offers something magical for every type of player. And for those seeking an extra challenge... the palace holds a secret just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/033ebba0a8377f59f611a6de3e439276.avif?t=1753429736\" /></div></p>","developers":["Studio Saffron Pvt Limited"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/header.jpg?t=1753429736","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</s